  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "うん、乾杯……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "灯織、今日からレッスン始めて大丈夫なんでしょ？\r\n復活して良かった～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020050,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "うん、本当に……！　体調は、もう大丈夫？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "おかげさまで、もういつも通り\r\nでも、ここまで祝うようなことじゃ……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そんなことないよ！　灯織が元気になったんだから！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ただの体調不良なのに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "みんなの時間もらっちゃって……\r\nなんか、申し訳ないかなって",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "あのねっ、灯織ちゃん、そうじゃなくて……！\r\nめぐるちゃんも私も、３人でいられるのが嬉しいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "だから……それもあわせての、お祝いなの\r\n……えっとね、その、だから──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そっか。真乃、ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……めぐるも、ありがとう\r\nそれに心配かけたよね。ふたりとも……ごめん",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020140,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "謝らないで、灯織ちゃん\r\nまた一緒に練習できるの、楽しみだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうそう！　灯織が元気になってくれたんだったら\r\n問題なしだよっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……でも、今日もレッスン場取れたらよかったのにね\r\nそしたら３人で練習できたのに～……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020170,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "仕方ないよ。場所、埋まっちゃってたし……\r\n今日はそれぞれ個人レッスンで頑張ろう",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……休んでた分、ふたりに追いつけるように\r\nちゃんと体を慣らしておく",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "じゃあわたしたちも灯織に負けないようにしなきゃだね！\r\nあ、でも、灯織はまだ頑張りすぎちゃダメだよ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……うん",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへー、じゃあ改めて、お祝い再開しよう！\r\n灯織、どれが食べたい？　言ってくれたら取るよ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "え？　いいよ別に\r\nほしいものがあったら、自分で取るし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020230,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "灯織ちゃん、飲み物のおかわりは？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020230"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "真乃まで……\r\nふたりともそんなに気を遣わなくても……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "気を遣ってるんじゃなくて、\r\nわたしたちがやりたいんだってば！　ね、真乃？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020260,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "うんっ。今日は、灯織ちゃんが主役のパーティーだから……\r\n灯織ちゃん、どれがいい？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……じゃあ\r\n向こうのキッシュをとってもらってもいい？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020270"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020280,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "うんっ\r\n……はい、どうぞ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いただきます\r\n……これ、美味しい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "本当！？　よかったぁ！　これね、真乃と一緒に作ったの！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020310,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "こういうのはあんまり作らないから、\r\n喜んでもらえるかなぁって心配だったんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ありがとう。本当に美味しいよ",
