  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020480,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やっぱり、イルミネーションスターズって最高だね！\r\n一緒にいるとこんなに楽しいんだもん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020480"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020490,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "うんっ\r\nみんなでいると、元気が出てくるよっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020490"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020500,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そうだね、私もそう思う",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020500"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020510,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ！　次の練習もすっごく楽しみ！\r\nわたしもう待ちきれないよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020510"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020520,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あのねっ、ふたりに聞いてほしいことがあって！\r\n灯織の家で話した後、色々考えてみたんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020520"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "mano"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020530,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "サビの部分の振りつけなんだけどね、こんな感じで、\r\nダイナミックなイメージでいくといいんじゃないかなって！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020530"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020540,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そっか……たしかに、その動きなら\r\nステージ映えもしそうだし、さらに曲の良さを出せるかも",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020540"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020550,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうだよね？　そうだよね！？\r\nあとあとっ、サビ前の部分とかもこんな感じで……あっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020550"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020560,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いっけない、今は灯織が元気になったお祝いだった\r\nごめん、気が早かったね",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020560"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020570,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ふふ。気にしないで\r\nお祝いしてもらえるのも嬉しいけど、話ができるのも嬉しい",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020570"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020580,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "イルミネーションスターズが……\r\n３人での活動が、ここから本当に始まった気がする",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020580"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020590,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だからそういう話、もっと聞きたいんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020590"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020600,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……あっ……あのっ……\r\nめぐるちゃんのイメージでやるなら……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020600"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020610,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "最後は、むんっ！　って感じにしてみるのはどうかな……？\r\nきっと合うんじゃないかなって、思うんだけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020610"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020620,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わぁ！　真乃、それすっごく良さそう！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020620"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020630,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……待って\r\nむんっ！　って感じってどういうこと……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300300502/3003005020630"
  },
  {
    "id": 3003005020640,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "え、えっと、むんっ！　はね、頑張るぞって感じの……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
